REM 🦆 X / Twitter Auto-Post Macro
REM Title: 🦆 X / Twitter Auto-Post
REM Description: Navigates to X compose modal, types custom post content with human jitter, takes a compose screenshot, and submits via Ctrl+Enter.
REM Tags: social, twitter, marketing, x
REM Variables: POST_TEXT, OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT

VAR POST_TEXT=Hello from a-bot with native DuckyScript automation! 🦆✨ Zero-detection browser workflows are live.
VAR OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT=x_compose.png

LOG Starting X / Twitter Auto-Post Workflow
NAVIGATE https://x.com/compose/post
WAIT_FOR [data-testid="tweetTextarea_0"], div[role="textbox"] 10000
RANDOM_DELAY 1500 2500

STRING $POST_TEXT
RANDOM_DELAY 1000 1800

SCREENSHOT $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
RANDOM_DELAY 800 1400

CTRL+ENTER
DELAY 3000
SCREENSHOT x_posted_final.png
LOG X / Twitter Post submitted successfully
